# - {{to_email}}      : Visitor's email address from the booking form
# - {{to_name}}       : Visitor's full name from the booking form
# - {{qr_code_link}}  : Dynamic entry ticket QR code URL (api.qrserver.com)
# - {{venue}}         : East Heritage Gate, IAM Kolkata Campus, Salt Lake
